{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":58704,\"title\":\"Bering Sea Gold\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In the frontier town of Nome, Alaska, there’s a gold rush on. But you've never seen gold mining like this before — here, the precious metal isn't found in the ground. It’s sitting in the most unlikely of places: the bottom of the frigid, unpredictable Bering Sea. And there are a handful of people willing to risk it all to bring it to the surface.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jrMvJCbdBEA6UphJhL4kgtmY5Pw.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jQD4XN0FFDElt9e8tFswiL7mibU.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":44,\"year\":2012,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":201,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-10-10\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3286241,\"name\":\"Shawn Pomrenke\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3DpeQUMLvBywWDnfTHo2bK4vU0y.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286245,\"name\":\"Vernon Adkison\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mK7MFmb6EOfvax5sR1p3uOceMVb.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286247,\"name\":\"Zeke Tenhoff\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8OmiDRJfo5JNdjsJEHpgcgYR5CA.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286250,\"name\":\"Kris Kelly\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pH6aerkqblBCLvHXzJLZKbhTgCt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1215558,\"name\":\"Mike Rowe\",\"character\":\"Himself (Narrator)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkNnugOmkMD1sXPCSQK1UZFAoWE.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"FsVcTcG2sgo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"7oWsznu_xfc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"UGhGD4d8xrk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":60381,\"title\":\"Mountain Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6OnwNi6qU3fbiyUChoKndiw69rS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42542372881355933,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":65043,\"title\":\"The Last Alaskans\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iY7oyaLFw5LrT2wvi6vcT9df9Mo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4247058823529412,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":66030,\"title\":\"Power & Ice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o4YDGY0F5wXQiwuIh9CZU3lWGqX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4203883495145631,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":247950,\"title\":\"America's Backyard Gold\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uRnEhTIIpn29DeFf8PgoFGdkWxu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4181818181818182,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":64639,\"title\":\"Railroad Alaska\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sXfWe8B1zlixCUrJb5ETixqkBMX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41724137931034483,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":133874,\"title\":\"Kodiak\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9unvPq1grcgy3itbhFC5uqSvBaw.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41621621621621624,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":60910,\"title\":\"Life Below Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a1pZCA3nmZvQGI1L21Riuglfw6f.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4061855670103093,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63462,\"title\":\"Edge of Alaska\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7Lm9qdBmKgwdIWQwniLUBZKbevO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.23333333333333334,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":34634,\"title\":\"Gold Rush\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zRlu3idMmqfrtnw7h2qHaAGzxnw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2272727272727273,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62041,\"title\":\"Alaska: Earth's Frozen Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w2WXnM9xRMHt57ls5gH1PeglUyV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.225,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128493,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: Winter's Fortune\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kK7W4fzovQQ5UPtDc7gbZfujDcf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.22181818181818183,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":64982,\"title\":\"Alaska Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sM41ap1J43tARURhVIqJYYmbkIn.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21690140845070424,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":19,\"seasonName\":\"Season 19\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Each season of the show follows a different group of dredgers, those who search for gold in shallow waters, at the bottom of the sea or even ocean. They often collect paydirt, ground from the seabed that contains some precious ore.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jrMvJCbdBEA6UphJhL4kgtmY5Pw.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-08-08\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Going Deep\",\"overview\":\"The race for untapped gold in bottomless depths kicks off as Chris and newcomer Joe go to war over a contested spot. Vern deploys an untested crew and new Nitrox air system for their deepest dives yet. Mr. Gold attempts to access riches via inland gold.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mzRjZktfqzDANcY3i1d3CUsfsgg.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-08\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Storm Warning\",\"overview\":\"The first storm of summer arrives to rock the fleet; rivals Chris and Joe battle over big gold; Vern's diver faces a deep-water emergency; Kris orders the Mistress to put her crew on notice; Shawn makes a promising discovery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wTsIcbQnBNpP9KkLgKToqcbf1Hh.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-15\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"High Stakes Hustle\",\"overview\":\"After a week lost to stormy weather, the fleet scrambles to make up for lost time in innovative ways; Shawn employs a risky hydraulic blaster, Chris gambles on a rookie diver, and Joe pushes himself and his dive crew to dangerous levels.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m7FtE04tewJXqroOOyOHmC5Ezcd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-22\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Stand Your Ground\",\"overview\":\"Tensions rise as the mining season hits its midpoint; the Kellys launch the All-In and Zeke hits the cheese; Shawn struggles to find a pay streak and an alleged claim jumper sets up on the Tomcod Claim hotspot.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/13JZKaXWR9NIzzOXeFNBSRz43xD.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-29\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Boiling Point\",\"overview\":\"Tensions explode on the Tomcod Claim; Chris takes radical action against a dredge he believes is jumping his claim; when a massive explosion blows a hole in the Mistress, Kris scrambles to save his livelihood.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k3MlrRZ4gxaBWKxykepNIrPJkgp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-05\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Big Bering Sea Gold Nugget\",\"overview\":\"The fleet goes for broke as Kris launches his crawler deeper than anyone has ever mined. Shawn must haul massive, season-saving equipment through a rising river, and Chris makes a historic discovery: the biggest gold nugget ever found offshore from Nome!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q6pDtnlJ6GxX49eUNkkbxDw3Hbv.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-12\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Pedal to the Gold Metal\",\"overview\":\"As the end of the mining season looms, the fleet has its richest week to date; Shawn unleashes a full force of equipment inland, Joe's marathon dives hit the jackpot and Chris fights against currents to reach his payday.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eL4EGhumvUN1mnMbk7BBb40mlhH.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-19\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Make or Break\",\"overview\":\"The weather is turning, and it's become \\\"make or break\\\" time for many miners in the fleet; Vern finds a lucky nugget, while Shawn battles freezing ground; Joe loses his ace diver; facing mutiny, Zeke pulls up his stakes to find a new claim.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9xzlHXRr9UcZLxoD81QqR5MYW7I.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-09-26\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Gold Can Mend a Broken Heart\",\"overview\":\"Last-minute hopes hang in the balance. Shawn follows old mining evidence as he hunts for his biggest gold haul yet, but Kris suffers a catastrophic failure on the All In that threatens to end not just his season, but his mining career.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tiO2ba3IJNgXP6CFMgF4sB06R8U.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-10-03\",\"runtime\":83},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Last Gasp for Gold\",\"overview\":\"In an epic finale, the fleet risks their operations for one last big payday as Nome Harbor freezes over. Shawn battles the inland ice, facing the facts; Chris goes for his biggest haul yet; and Vern overcomes the loss of his key diver for a big payday.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oQcpErEUsGd2DOEkVY8gmsePDP3.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-10-10\",\"runtime\":83}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-01-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}